<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>HosBank — Next Generation Digital Banking</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <style>
        .hero-section {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #070e1b 0%, #0f172a 50%, #1e293b 100%);
            color: #ffffff;
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            padding: 4rem 3rem;
            margin: 2rem 0;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        .hero-section::after {
            content: "";
            position: absolute;
            top: -30%;
            right: -10%;
            width: 500px;
            height: 500px;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2) 0%, rgba(37, 99, 235, 0) 70%);
            border-radius: 50%;
            pointer-events: none;
        }

        .hero-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.2);
            border: 1px solid rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.4);
            color: #93c5fd;
            padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
            border-radius: var(--radius-full);
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .hero-title {
            font-size: 2.75rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            line-height: 1.15;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: #ffffff;
        }

        .hero-desc {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            color: #94a3b8;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .hero-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 1rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .feature-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
            margin-top: 2rem;
        }

        .feature-card {
            background: #ffffff;
            border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            padding: 2rem;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
        }

        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 1.75rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            display: inline-block;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav class="bank-nav">
        <div class="bank-nav-container">
            <a class="navbar-brand" href="/">
                HosBank <span class="logo-badge">Secure</span>
            </a>
            <div class="navbar-nav">
                <a class="nav-link" href="/auth/login">Login</a>
                <a class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" href="/auth/register" style="color: white !important;">Open Account</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="hero-section">
            <span class="hero-badge">Enterprise Grade Financial Services</span>
            <h1 class="hero-title">Simple, Reliable & Secure Banking</h1>
            <p class="hero-desc">
                Manage accounts, instant transfers, smart beneficiary directories, and payment cards with complete transparency and modern security.
            </p>
            <div class="hero-actions">
                <a href="/auth/login" class="btn btn-primary" style="padding: 0.8rem 1.75rem; font-size: 1rem;">
                    Access Online Portal
                </a>
                <a href="/auth/register" class="btn btn-secondary" style="padding: 0.8rem 1.75rem; font-size: 1rem; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); color: white; border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);">
                    Create Client Account
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-grid">
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">🛡️</div>
                <h3>Institutional Security</h3>
                <p>Protected by multi-step authentication, encrypted sessions, and direct compliance oversight.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>
                <h3>Instant Fund Transfers</h3>
                <p>Transfer funds immediately between accounts and verified beneficiaries with instant confirmation.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card">
                <div class="feature-icon">💳</div>
                <h3>Comprehensive Card Controls</h3>
                <p>Instantly request card PINs, view card details, or trigger emergency card opposition 24/7.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
